  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="9aed1e8b-8ed0-5669-b805-68e894a60f22" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="FIRST-match v1: SUSPENDED -&gt; DENY/SUSPENDED; missing remaining fact -&gt; NEEDS_INFO/MISSING_FACT; inactive/expired membership -&gt; DENY/MEMBERSHIP_INACTIVE; expired certificate -&gt; DENY/CERTIFICATION_EXPIRED; bookings &gt;= 3 -&gt; WAITLIST/BOOKING_LIMIT; default -&gt; ALLOW/ELIGIBLE.&#10;UTC validity dates are inclusive; malformed dates/enums/counts are request errors rather than NEEDS_INFO.&#10;Persist immutable facts/hash and actual policy version; same request key and same facts/version returns the same decision, changed reuse conflicts.&#10;Only the policy owner activates reviewed versions; evaluator implementation is developer-owned, with independent expected vectors.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
